cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "plssempower: Power and Sensitivity Analysis for PLS-SEM"
abstract: >-
  Functions and graphical tools to perform power analysis and sensitivity
  analysis for Partial Least Squares Structural Equation Models (PLS-SEM),
  based on the inverse square root method of Kock and Hadaya (2018). The
  package estimates required sample sizes or Minimum Detectable Effect Sizes
  (MDES) for user-defined significance levels, one- or two-tailed tests and
  statistical power. A companion Shiny App performs the same computations
  online.
